# 1. Define Engine Constraints
SIM_TIME 100

# 2. Define Wires
WIRE System_Clock
WIRE Data_In
WIRE DFF_Output

# 3. Inject Hardware Faults
# The Data_In wire will be permanently short-circuited to Ground
FAULT STUCK_AT_0 Data_In

# 4. Define Components
# CLOCK ID Period Output
CLOCK MasterClk 20 System_Clock

# DFF ID Delay DataIn ClockIn Output
DFF RegisterA 5 Data_In System_Clock DFF_Output